<title>UK: Citibank sets call, put warrants on S&amp;P 500 index.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets call, put warrants on S&amp;P 500 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank NA has issued 80 million call and put warrants, in four equal tranches, on the S&amp;P 500 index, lead manager Citibank SA said.</p>
<p>10 warrants control one index.</p>
<p> WARRANTS     STRIKE	ISS PRICE     PREMIUM	 GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	 800	   19.40 FRF	12.88 PCT    20.0 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT B	  800	   41.30 FRF     - 2.73 PCT     9.4 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT C	  760	   29.30 FRF     - 5.04 PCT    13.3 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT D	  720	   21.00 FRF     - 8.30 PCT    18.5 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 09.DEC.96-12.DEC.97   PAYDATE	09.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   PARIS		     MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  741.50</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
